* Task completion includes every internal Also branch.
* The response becomes eligible 1 second after monitoring finishes.
* Expected: monitor Think 0-1s, Look 0-4s, Click 1-2s; response Say 5-6s.
* The response is deliberately declared first to test forward references.

Task: Respond as response starting_after monitor finishes plus 1 seconds
. Goal: Announce completion
. . Say Complete (1 seconds)

Task: Monitor as monitor starting_at 0 seconds
. Goal: Check system
. . Think about System (1 seconds)
. . Also: Watch display as visual
. . . Goal: Observe display
. . . . Look at Display (4 seconds)
. . Click Acknowledge (1 seconds)
